  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nWhen you die, you appear in a cinema with a number of other people who look like you. You find out that they are your previous reincarnations, and soon you all begin watching your next life on the big screen.\n\nI began to wonder where I was at. \"What exactly is this place?\", I wondered. \"Am I in a world-between-worlds?\" \nI felt a bit uneasy.  I was in a place I didn't know, with people I didn't know. I didn't know what was going to happen to me.\n\nI looked around for someone to ask. I saw a man who looked like me. He had similar clothes, gender, hair, and seemed to be from a more recent era. Many of the people had older clothing, from the 50s, 60s, 70s, and 80s, but his outfit looked modern. \n\n\"Excuse me,\" I said to him. \"Can you tell me where I am?\" \n\"You're in the cinema,\" he said. \"You died, and now you're watching your next life.\" \n\"But what is this place?\" I said. \"Is it a world-between-worlds?\" \n\"No,\" he said. \"This is the cinema.\"  Finding him very useless, I approached the woman next to him. \n\"Excuse me,\" I said to her.",
